{"id":9020,"date":"2026-01-13T13:41:35","date_gmt":"2026-01-13T13:41:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/profiphotoskills.com\/?page_id=9020"},"modified":"2026-08-31T14:00:46","modified_gmt":"2026-08-31T14:00:46","slug":"psycho","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/prophotoskills.com\/psycho\/","title":{"rendered":"PSYCHO"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"et_pb_section_0 et_pb_section et_section_regular et_flex_section\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_row_0 et_pb_row et_flex_row\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_0 et_pb_column et_flex_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et_flex_column_18_24 et_flex_column_16_24_tablet et_flex_column_24_24_phone\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_row_1 et_pb_row et_pb_row_nested et_flex_row\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_1 et_pb_column et-last-child et_flex_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et_flex_column_24_24 et_flex_column_24_24_tablet et_flex_column_24_24_phone\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_code_0 et_pb_code et_pb_module\"><div class=\"et_pb_code_inner\"><\/div><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_0 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module\"><div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h1><span style=\"color: #f09b61;\"><strong>PSYCHO<\/strong><\/span><\/h1>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"et_pb_row_2 et_pb_row et_pb_row_nested et_flex_row\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_2 et_pb_column et-last-child et_flex_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et_flex_column_24_24 et_flex_column_24_24_tablet et_flex_column_24_24_phone\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_text_1 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module\"><div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><h1 data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1377\">Fotograf Mindset und Kommunikation sind entscheidend f\u00fcr erfolgreiche Shootings. Denn Fotografie ist nicht nur Technik \u2013 sie ist Arbeit mit Menschen, Emotionen und Energie. Wer ein Set f\u00fchren will, muss verstehen, wie Vertrauen entsteht, wie Kommunikation wirkt und wie Stimmung Bilder beeinflusst.<\/h1>\n<h1 data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1602\">In dieser Kategorie lernst du, wie du als Fotograf mit Models, Kunden und Teams arbeitest, wie du Pr\u00e4senz aufbaust und wie du auch unter Druck souver\u00e4n bleibst. Es geht nicht um Theorie, sondern um echte Situationen am Set.<\/h1>\n<h1 data-start=\"1604\" data-end=\"1715\">Von K\u00f6rpersprache \u00fcber Gespr\u00e4chsf\u00fchrung bis hin zu mentaler St\u00e4rke \u2013 professionelle Fotografie beginnt im Kopf.<\/h1>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"et_pb_row_3 et_pb_row et_pb_row_nested et_flex_row\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_3 et_pb_column et_flex_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et_flex_column_12_24 et_flex_column_12_24_tablet et_flex_column_24_24_phone\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_image_0 et_pb_image et_pb_module et_flex_module\"><span class=\"et_pb_image_wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/prophotoskills.github.io\/pps-assets\/images\/T03_E01_Houston-wir-haben-ein-Problem_1553x1024_k.webp\" alt=\"Fotograf im Gespr\u00e4ch mit Kundin am Set, w\u00e4hrend gemeinsam Bilder und Konzept besprochen werden, als Beispiel f\u00fcr Kommunikation und Entscheidungsprozesse w\u00e4hrend eines Shootings\" title=\"Warum Set-Changes kein Angriff sind \u2013 und wie du trotz spontaner Kundenw\u00fcnsche die kreative F\u00fchrung beh\u00e4ltst\" width=\"1533\" height=\"1022\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1533px) 100vw, 1533px\" class=\"wp-image-227321\" \/><\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_4 et_pb_column et-last-child et_flex_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et_flex_column_12_24 et_flex_column_12_24_tablet et_flex_column_24_24_phone\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_blog_0 et_pb_blog et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_posts et_pb_module\" title=\"Wie du Probleme im Fotoshooting souver\u00e4n l\u00f6st: Ruhe bewahren, strukturiert reagieren und professionelle Qualit\u00e4t sichern.\" alt=\"Probleme im Fotoshooting l\u00f6sen\"><div class=\"et_pb_ajax_pagination_container\"><div class=\"et_pb_blog_posts et_flex_module\"><article class=\"et_pb_post et_pb_post_id_8903 clearfix et_pb_blog_item_0_0 post-8903 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-psycho category-t03_e01 tag-psycho tag-t03_e01\"><h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"https:\/\/prophotoskills.com\/t03_e01_houston-wir-haben-ein-problem\/\">\u201eHouston, wir haben ein Problem&#8230;\u201c<\/a><\/h2><p class=\"post-meta\"><span class=\"entry-categories\"><a href=\"https:\/\/prophotoskills.com\/category\/psycho\/\" rel=\"tag\">PSYCHO<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/prophotoskills.com\/category\/psycho\/t03_e01\/\" rel=\"tag\">T03_E01<\/a><\/span><\/p><div class=\"post-content\"><div class=\"post-content-inner\"><p>Wenn am Set pl\u00f6tzlich alles kippt, zeigt sich Professionalit\u00e4t. Warum deine Reaktion im Krisenmoment wichtiger ist als jede Kameraeinstellung.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/article><\/div><div class=\"pagination clearfix\">\n\t<div class=\"alignleft\"><\/div>\n\t<div class=\"alignright\"><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<div class=\"et_pb_row_4 et_pb_row et_pb_row_nested et_grid_row et_flex_column_24_24_phone\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_column_5 et_pb_column et_flex_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough\">\n<div class=\"et_pb_blog_1 et_pb_blog et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_posts et_pb_module preset--module--divi-blog--l78pwyo9oq\" title=\"Warum spontane \u00c4nderungen im Fotoshooting riskant sind: Planung sichern, Struktur bewahren und professionelle Ergebnisse zuverl\u00e4ssig liefern.\" alt=\"Spontane \u00c4nderungen im Fotoshooting\"><div class=\"et_pb_ajax_pagination_container\"><div class=\"et_pb_blog_posts et_flex_module\"><article class=\"et_pb_post et_pb_post_id_8913 clearfix et_pb_blog_item_1_0 post-8913 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-psycho category-t03_l01 tag-psycho tag-t03_l01\"><a href=\"https:\/\/prophotoskills.com\/t03_l01_warum-spontane-aenderunge